{maketoc}

If you know what a MOO is and would like to work on or visit the Lojban MOO in progress (it's having the stuffing ripped out of it to make it multilingual), please visit ((Lojban IRC)).

! To-Do Lists

Put stuff here that you'd like to see or that you know needs work.

* ((Lojban MOO General Bugs))
* ((Lojban MOO Translation-Related Bugs)) -- anything having to do with translation functionality
* ((Lojban MOO Untranslated Messages)) -- if you're in Lojban and you see something in English, it goes here
* ((Lojban MOO Feature Requests))

! Beta Release Checklist

So it seems to me that we're really close to being able to let the community at large know about this thing.  Here are the things ((Robin Lee Powell|I)) would like to see happen first:

# Make the ((English mooix test script|English)) and ((Lojban mooix test script|Lojban)) test scripts be fairly substantial tests of the user- (and builder-, to an extent) capabilities of the moo.
# Get all the messages the scripts use translated.
# Run the scripts and post the results here.
# Make Lojban help files for at least the basics.  See ((Lojban MOO Help Files Translations)).
# Some documentation on what needs to be done to make a multilingual MOO of one's own.

